// .vendor.jsonc — vendored library manifest for livespec-dev-tooling.
//
// Validated by `just check-vendor-manifest`: every entry must carry a
// non-empty upstream_url, a non-empty upstream_ref, and a parseable-ISO
// vendored_at. `shim: true` is required on the hand-authored jsoncomment
// shim (per livespec-core's v026 D1 reclassification) and forbidden on
// every other entry.
//
// `tomli` is vendored for the `livespec_dev_tooling.config` loader: the
// repo's 3.10 floor (SPECIFICATION/constraints.md §"Runtime") has no
// stdlib `tomllib`, so the loader falls back to this vendored copy (per
// SPECIFICATION/contracts.md §"Configuration loader"). On Python 3.11+
// the loader prefers stdlib `tomllib` and this copy is unused.
//
// `returns` is vendored to satisfy livespec
// `SPECIFICATION/non-functional-requirements.md` §"Shared content
// provenance": every governed repo carrying first-party Python "MUST put
// its product logic on the `Result` / `IOResult` railway ...
// `dry-python/returns` is vendored under `_vendor/`". This repo — the
// enforcement suite itself — carried no copy, so it could not compose on
// the railway even in principle. Version 0.25.0 matches the copy
// `livespec` vendors — a PAIRWISE match between two repos, and the
// whole of what this entry claims. It asserts nothing fleet-wide,
// because nothing fleet-wide is true: measured 2026-08-03 the fleet
// carried three distinct `returns` provenances — `0.25.0` here and in
// `livespec`, `0.26.0` in `livespec-orchestrator-git-jsonl`, and the
// commit-pin copy-of-a-copy
// `e2cdeea:.claude-plugin/scripts/_vendor/returns` in
// `livespec-orchestrator-beads-fabro`, whose upstream version no
// manifest records. Nothing computes a cross-repo `upstream_ref`
// comparison — `check-vendor-manifest` validates each entry's SHAPE
// only — so an annotation here cannot know a fleet-wide property and
// must not claim one.
// Landed as step 1 of livespec-dev-tooling-8o8e; the false fleet-wide
// clause was removed, and the measurement above recorded in its place,
// by livespec-dev-tooling-yteb.
//
// `livespec_runtime` is the one PARTIAL entry, and the one first-party
// one. Only the `github_budget*` modules are copied — the budget-aware
// GitHub client that `livespec_dev_tooling/budgeted_gh.py` routes every
// first-party forge read through, together with its transitive PURE
// dependencies (stdlib, plus the `returns` copy already vendored above)
// and the package `__init__.py` / `py.typed` the import path needs.
// Vendoring rather than depending is what the retrofit's acceptance
// required, and the reason is that this package is installed into every
// governed sibling repo: a dependency edge onto a second first-party
// distribution would have to be satisfied in all of them. `upstream_ref`
// is the livespec-runtime `origin/master` COMMIT the bytes were taken
// from rather than a release, so the provenance is exact.
// ⚠️ `python -m livespec_dev_tooling.vendor_update livespec_runtime`
// would copy the WHOLE package over this partial tree. Re-vendor by
// copying the `github_budget*` modules across by hand and re-stamping
// this entry. Landed by livespec-dev-tooling-z69s.
{
  "libraries": [
    {
      "name": "returns",
      "upstream_url": "https://github.com/dry-python/returns",
      "upstream_ref": "0.25.0",
      "vendored_at": "2026-07-27T19:20:00Z"
    },
    {
      "name": "structlog",
      "upstream_url": "https://github.com/hynek/structlog",
      "upstream_ref": "25.5.0",
      "vendored_at": "2026-04-26T06:05:33Z"
    },
    {
      "name": "jsoncomment",
      "upstream_url": "https://pypi.org/project/jsoncomment/",
      "upstream_ref": "0.4.2",
      "vendored_at": "2026-04-26T06:05:33Z",
      "shim": true
    },
    {
      "name": "tomli",
      "upstream_url": "https://github.com/hukkin/tomli",
      "upstream_ref": "2.4.1",
      "vendored_at": "2026-05-30T21:48:23Z"
    },
    {
      "name": "livespec_runtime",
      "upstream_url": "https://github.com/thewoolleyman/livespec-runtime",
      "upstream_ref": "4c2f5e84015309894647a83dfa2c4b85a4b8ebf7",
      "vendored_at": "2026-09-12T02:33:00Z"
    }
  ]
}
